1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,902
Meet RowTabs. A free,

2
00:00:01,952 --> 00:00:06,673
open source Airtable alternative that lives entirely in your browser.

3
00:00:06,723 --> 00:00:10,199
Editable tables, sorting, filters, an AI assistant,

4
00:00:10,249 --> 00:00:14,209
and a hundred ready-made templates. No account, no server,

5
00:00:14,259 --> 00:00:15,661
and it works offline.

6
00:00:17,411 --> 00:00:18,905
Start from the gallery.

7
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:22,600
A hundred ready-made tables for CRMs, leads, pipelines,

8
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:26,630
digital products, e-commerce, and more, grouped by category.

9
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,704
Search is fuzzy,

10
00:00:27,754 --> 00:00:32,272
so typing table for leads WhatsApp finds exactly the table you mean.

11
00:00:32,322 --> 00:00:32,742
Add it,

12
00:00:32,792 --> 00:00:36,369
and you get the right columns and sample rows to edit.

13
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:43,977
Every cell is editable.

14
00:00:44,027 --> 00:00:47,439
Click a status chip to rename it or pick a new color.

15
00:00:47,489 --> 00:00:50,771
Choose dates from a calendar, and add bold, italic,

16
00:00:50,821 --> 00:00:51,881
or links to text.

17
00:00:51,931 --> 00:00:54,559
Add a column and pick from sixteen types,

18
00:00:54,609 --> 00:00:58,021
like ratings, sliders, phone numbers, files, avatars,

19
00:00:58,071 --> 00:01:01,483
and syntax highlighted code with a language dropdown.

20
00:01:12,504 --> 00:01:14,072
Click any header to sort.

21
00:01:14,122 --> 00:01:15,884
Search every column at once,

22
00:01:15,934 --> 00:01:19,184
stack filters like value greater than ten thousand,

23
00:01:19,234 --> 00:01:21,902
and drag rows and columns to reorder them.

24
00:01:21,952 --> 00:01:24,555
Select all with one click to delete rows,

25
00:01:24,605 --> 00:01:26,044
or send them to the AI.

26
00:01:34,547 --> 00:01:36,524
Tables can live inside tables.

27
00:01:36,574 --> 00:01:39,632
Add a table link column, search for any table,

28
00:01:39,682 --> 00:01:42,943
or create a new linked table right from the cell.

29
00:01:42,993 --> 00:01:43,957
In the sidebar,

30
00:01:44,007 --> 00:01:46,930
drag a table into a folder or another table,

31
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:49,025
and give each one its own icon.

32
00:01:50,775 --> 00:01:53,667
Bring your own data. Drop in a CSV, Excel,

33
00:01:53,717 --> 00:01:55,278
JSON, or Markdown file,

34
00:01:55,328 --> 00:01:58,291
review the column types that were detected,

35
00:01:58,341 --> 00:01:59,762
and create the table.

36
00:01:59,812 --> 00:02:03,055
Everything is imported locally in your browser.

37
00:02:04,805 --> 00:02:08,803
Export in one click. Copy the table as Markdown,

38
00:02:08,853 --> 00:02:12,597
or download a PDF, CSV, HTML, Markdown, JSON,

39
00:02:12,647 --> 00:02:15,801
or SQL file. Or view the table as SQL,

40
00:02:15,851 --> 00:02:17,488
React code, or JSON,

41
00:02:17,538 --> 00:02:20,777
and copy it straight into your project.

42
00:02:22,527 --> 00:02:24,409
Every open table gets a tab.

43
00:02:24,459 --> 00:02:27,171
Split view puts two tables side by side,

44
00:02:27,221 --> 00:02:29,794
with a divider you can drag to resize.

45
00:02:33,963 --> 00:02:36,493
The AI assistant works on your tables.

46
00:02:36,543 --> 00:02:39,548
Press ⌘L, add your own OpenRouter key,

47
00:02:39,598 --> 00:02:42,196
and ask in plain English. It adds rows,

48
00:02:42,246 --> 00:02:44,776
edits cells, and creates whole tables,

49
00:02:44,826 --> 00:02:47,628
and every change comes with Keep and Undo.

50
00:02:47,678 --> 00:02:50,276
Deleting a table always asks you first.

51
00:02:55,044 --> 00:02:57,604
Press command K to search your tables,

52
00:02:57,654 --> 00:03:00,350
add gallery examples, ask the assistant,

53
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,204
or open the M C P settings.

54
00:03:02,254 --> 00:03:05,431
A getting started page documents every feature,

55
00:03:05,481 --> 00:03:08,177
and ten color themes, in light and dark,

56
00:03:08,227 --> 00:03:09,138
make it yours.

57
00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:16,059
Everything is stored in your browser with IndexedDB. Private,

58
00:03:16,109 --> 00:03:17,026
fast, and free.

59
00:03:17,076 --> 00:03:19,796
There are sensible limits to keep it quick:

60
00:03:19,846 --> 00:03:22,244
two hundred tables, two thousand rows,

61
00:03:22,294 --> 00:03:25,143
and forty columns per table. Export any time.

62
00:03:26,893 --> 00:03:29,714
RowTabs is open source and free. Star it,

63
00:03:29,764 --> 00:03:32,165
fork it, and build your own tables.

64
00:03:32,215 --> 00:03:36,016
Find it on GitHub at shrey vijay vargiya slash rowtabs.
